src/content/works/alfa-romeo-giulia/inde.2ed8a5927d3ddd63:
Alfa Romeo Giulia 2021. godine je došla kod nas u Beogradu na planirano servisiranje. Nismo se ograničili samo na zamenu ulja: pregledali smo sve potrošne delove i istovremeno obavili servis automatske transmisije.

Šta smo uradili:

- zamenili sveće;
- zamenili motorno ulje;
- zamenili filter ulja;
- zamenili vazdušni filter;
- zamenili kabinski filter;
- potpuno zamenili karter automatske transmisije;
- zamenili ulje u automatskoj transmisiji ZF 8HP.

Posebnu pažnju smo posvetili transmisiji. Kod automatskih prenosa **ZF 8HP**, stanje ulja i kartera je potrebno držati pod kontrolom i ne odlagati servis: na vreme servisirana transmisija je znatno jeftinija od one koja je kasnije morala da se popravlja.

src/content/works/alfa-romeo-giulia/inde.e56766c48bb91541:
The 2021 Alfa Romeo Giulia came to us in Belgrade for scheduled maintenance. We didn't stop at just an oil change; we went through all the consumables and also serviced the automatic transmission.

What we did:

- replaced the spark plugs;
- replaced the engine oil;
- replaced the oil filter;
- replaced the air filter;
- replaced the cabin filter;
- completely replaced the automatic transmission oil pan;
- changed the oil in the ZF 8HP transmission.

We paid special attention to the transmission. For **ZF 8HP** automatics, it's essential to monitor the condition of the oil and pan and not delay maintenance: a well-maintained transmission costs considerably less than a repaired one.

src/content/works/audi-q7/index.md.13b0b8a285ab9130:
**2008 Audi Q7. Extensive list of services at our car service in Belgrade, Serbia.**

We received a 2008 Audi Q7 with an impressive list of issues. The vehicle required significant attention both in terms of its suspension and engine.

What was done:

- Replacement of suspension arms;
- Replacement of brake discs and pads;
- Work on engine alignment;
- Resealing the intake system;
- Replacement of the EGR pipe;
- Minor maintenance including oil and filter changes.

An additional issue was a persistent engine oil leak. During the previous service, the drain plug had been installed incorrectly, causing oil to continuously drip from the engine. We fixed the problem and got everything back in order.

The first-generation Audi Q7 requires careful maintenance, especially in older vehicles with high mileage: it is important to understand the root cause of the malfunction and address it, rather than simply replacing the part.

src/content/works/audi-q7/index.md.ffcf0f63c8436059:
**Audi Q7 2008. Veliki spisak radova u našem servisu u Beogradu, Srbija.**

Kod nas je stigla Audi Q7 2008. sa impresivnim spiskom kvarova. Automobil je zahtevao ozbiljnu pažnju kako na suspenziji, tako i na motoru.

Šta je urađeno:

- zamena prednjih i zadnjih krakova;  
- zamena kočionih diskova i pločica;  
- radovi na uglovima točkova;  
- zamena brtvila usisnog sistema;  
- zamena EGR cevi;  
- osnovno tehničko održavanje sa promenom ulja i filtera.

Poseban problem je bio povezan sa stalnom propašću motornog ulja. Nakon prethodnog servisa, drenažna čepka je bila postavljena netačno, i ulje je neprekidno kapalo iz motora. Problem je rešen, sve je dovedeno u red.

Audi Q7 prve generacije zahteva stručno održavanje, posebno na starijim vozilima sa velikim pređenim kilometrima: važno je otkriti šta je uzrok kvara i otkloniti uzrok, a ne samo zameniti deo.

src/content/works/mercedes-benz-c200/ind.80bbc2bc6e2f023e:
A Mercedes-Benz C-Class W205 arrived at our car service in Belgrade for a minor maintenance check.

We completed the following:

- oil change;
- oil filter replacement;
- engine air filter replacement;
- cabin air filter replacement;
- replacement of all brake pads;
- servicing and inspection of the braking system.

Speaking specifically about the brakes, brake pads are one of the key safety components, and it's important to check them regularly. When we replace the pads, we always take a look at the **discs, calipers, and guides**: if any of these parts are corroded or worn out, the car will not brake evenly.

src/content/works/mercedes-benz-c200/ind.eeee4f0587255817:
Mercedes-Benz C-Class W205 je došao u naš servis u Beogradu na mali servis.

Urađeno je:

- zamena motornih ulja;
- zamena uljnog filtera;
- zamena filtera vazduha motora;
- zamena kabinskog filtera;
- zamena svih kočionih pločica;
- servisiranje i provera kočionog sistema.

Posebno o kočnicama. Pločice su jedan od ključnih elemenata sigurnosti, zato ih treba redovno pratiti. Kada menjamo pločice, uvek proveravamo takođe **diskove, klipse i vodiče**: ako je nešto od toga zarobljeno ili istrošeno, kočenje vozila će biti neravnomerno.

src/content/works/mini-cooper-sd/index.m.596ba06341d6d94e:
The MINI Cooper SD with a diesel **2.0 B47 engine producing 170 hp** came to our service center in Belgrade for comprehensive maintenance.

We performed the following services:

- engine oil replacement;
- all filters replacement;
- fuel filter replacement;
- oil change in the 8-speed Aisin automatic transmission;
- computer diagnostics of the engine and electronic systems;
- intake system diagnostics.

The fuel filter on a diesel engine should be replaced no less than once every **20,000 km**: this protects the fuel system and ensures the engine operates smoothly.

During the intake diagnostics, we discovered significant contamination: the swirl flaps were coated with soot and carbon buildup, creating a dense layer. We recommended a cleaning, which the owner accepted, and the intake was thoroughly cleaned.

The B47 diesel engine in BMW and MINI, along with the Aisin automatic transmission and intake system, thrive on regular maintenance: timely oil and filter changes, and keeping an eye on the intake condition. This way, expensive repairs can be postponed for a long time.

src/content/works/mini-cooper-sd/index.m.e8bcb915c90e3b28:
MINI Cooper SD sa dizel motorom **2.0 B47 od 170 k** stigao je u naš servis u Beogradu na kompletnu uslugu.

Izvršili smo:

- zamenu motornog ulja;
- zamenu svih filtera;
- zamenu gorivnog filtera;
- zamenu ulja u 8-stepenom automatskom menjaču Aisin;
- kompjutersku dijagnostiku motora i elektronskih sistema;
- dijagnostiku usisnog sistema.

Gorivni filter kod dizela treba menjati najmanje jednom na **20 000 km**: tako se štiti gorivni sistem, a motor radi stabilno.

Tokom dijagnostike usisa otkrili smo značajno zagađenje: vortex lopatice su bile prekrivene čađom i naslagama, gustim „kaputom“. Ponudili smo vlasniku čišćenje, on je pristao, i usis je potpuno očišćen.

Dizel B47 na BMW i MINI, automatski menjač Aisin i usisni sistem vole redovnost: na vreme menjati ulje i filtere, obratiti pažnju na stanje usisa. Tada se skupi popravak odlaže na duže vreme.

src/content/works/obsluzhivanie-tormozno.98528494f3cbd110:
U naš servis u Beogradu stiglo je vozilo sa pritužbom na **vibraciju tokom kočenja**: vozač pritisne kočnicu, i automobil počne da se trese.

Počeli smo sa balansiranjem točkova. Ovo je najčešći uzrok takve vibracije i najlakše ga je isključiti. Balansiranje je bilo u redu, pa smo nastavili sa proverom kočionog sistema.

Na prvi pogled, diskovi i kočione obloge su bili u dobrom stanju, bez vidljivih tragova jakog trošenja. Prilikom pažljivog pregleda otkriveno je da je **levi kočioni disk deformisan**. On je bio uzrok vibracije.

Pshowali smo klijentu i saglasili se oko popravke. Šta smo uradili:

- dijagnostika kočionog sistema;
- proverenje i balansiranje točkova;
- utvrđivanje deformacije levog kočionog diska;
- zamena kočionih diskova;
- zamena kočionih obloga;
- ponovna provera balansiranja točkova;
- kontrolna vožnja nakon popravke.

Vibracija prilikom kočenja nakon ovoga je potpuno nestala, vozilo je provereno i vraćeno vlasniku.

Disk može izgledati normalno, a da pri tom bude kriv, takvu deformaciju nije moguće uočiti običnim okom. Zato, ako primetite podrhtavanje volana, vibraciju pedale ili karoserije prilikom kočenja, dijagnostiku ne treba odlagati.

src/content/works/obsluzhivanie-tormozno.e959a534e5d3d8a7:
A car came into our service center in Belgrade with a complaint of **vibration while braking**: the driver hits the pedal and the vehicle starts shaking.

We began with a wheel balance check. This is the most common cause of such vibration, and it's the easiest to rule out. The balance turned out to be fine, so we continued examining the braking system.

Visually, the rotors and pads seemed to be in good condition, with no obvious signs of severe wear. However, upon closer inspection, it was discovered that the **left brake rotor was deformed**. This was causing the vibration.

We showed the findings to the client and approved the repair. Here’s what we did:

- diagnostic check of the braking system;
- wheel check and balancing;
- identification of the deformation in the left brake rotor;
- replacement of the brake rotors;
- replacement of the brake pads;
- rechecking the wheel balance;
- test drive after the repair.

The vibration while braking completely disappeared after these repairs, and the car was checked and returned to the owner.

A rotor may look fine but can still be bent, which is not something easily spotted by the naked eye. So if you experience steering wheel shaking, pedal vibration, or body shaking while braking, it’s best not to put off diagnostics.

src/content/works/peugeot-308-sw/index.m.4ff8d2211b4eaa28:
The 2024 Peugeot 308 with a **1.5 BlueHDi** diesel engine came to our Russian car service in Belgrade for a major service. We performed a complete set of tasks:

- timing belt replacement;
- water pump replacement;
- coolant replacement;
- engine oil replacement;
- filter replacements;
- inspection and servicing of all related components.

There is a specific detail to note about the 1.5 BlueHDi engine: the camshaft drive chain. Early versions of the engine had a chain that was **7 mm** wide. Over time, this chain can stretch, and in the worst-case scenario, it may break, leading to severe engine damage.

When servicing such engines, it is recommended to install a reinforced **8 mm** chain, along with the camshaft bed and the camshafts themselves. For the 2023-2024 Peugeot 308 models, the 8 mm chain is already factory-installed.

This means that during a major service, it's important to check not only the timing belt but also the camshaft chain, considering the known characteristics of this particular engine.

src/content/works/peugeot-308-sw/index.m.9b5995496644cca8:
Peugeot 308 iz 2024. godine sa dizel motorom **1.5 BlueHDi** došao je kod nas u ruski auto servis u Beogradu na veliki servis. Obavili smo kompletan spektar radova:

- zamena zupčastog remena;
- zamena vodene pumpe;
- zamena antifriza;
- zamena motornog ulja;
- zamena filtera;
- provera i održavanje svih pratećih komponenti.

Kod motora 1.5 BlueHDi postoji jedan važan detalj koji vredi posebno pomenuti: lanac koji pokreće bregaste osovine. U ranijim verzijama motora bio je lanac širine **7 mm**. Vremenom se istegne, a u najgorem slučaju može da se slomi i povuče za sobom motor.

Prilikom održavanja ovakvih motora preporučuje se postavljanje pojačanog lanca **8 mm**, zajedno sa postoljem bregastih osovina i samim bregastim osovinama. Na Peugeot 308 modelima iz 2023–2024. godine lanac od **8 mm** već dolazi sa fabrike.

To znači da prilikom velikog servisa treba obratiti pažnju ne samo na zupčasti remen, već i na lanac bregastih osovina, kao i na poznate karakteristike konkretnog motora.

src/content/works/seat-leon/index.md.4adb9b3dcc4f3028:
A used Seat Leon with a mileage of **190,000 km** arrived at our Russian car service in Belgrade for a major scheduled maintenance, also known as a full service.

At this mileage, it's best to service the main components right away, so we performed the following:

- replaced the timing belt kit;
- replaced the water pump;
- replaced the coolant;
- replaced the engine oil;
- replaced all necessary filters;
- replaced the rear shock absorbers;
- replaced the oil in the DSG DQ250 gearbox.

For Seat, Volkswagen, Škoda, and Audi, a full service is a key point of maintenance. Timely changes of the timing belt, pump, technical fluids, and consumables help avoid much more expensive issues down the line.

A note on the **DQ250**. This is a six-speed robot with wet clutches, and the transmission oil needs to be replaced as per the maintenance schedule: that’s what keeps the gearbox functioning properly.

src/content/works/seat-leon/index.md.b8b056dfd6b3f69e:
Seat Leon sa pređenih **190 000 km** stigao je u naš ruski auto servis u Beogradu na veliko planirano održavanje, to jest veliki servis.

Na ovakvom pređenom putu osnovne sklopove je bolje servisirati odmah, tako da smo uradili:

- zamenu kompleta zupčastog remena;
- zamenu vodene pumpe;
- zamenu antifriza;
- zamenu motornog ulja;
- zamenu svih potrebnih filtera;
- zamenu zadnjih amortizera;
- zamenu ulja u DSG DQ250 menjaču.

Za Seat, Volkswagen, Škoda i Audi, veliki servis je osnovna tačka održavanja. Zupčasti remen, pumpa, tehničke tečnosti i potrošni delovi, kada se menjaju na vreme, izbegavaju mnogo skuplje neprijatnosti kasnije.

Posebno o **DQ250**. Ovo je šestostepeni robot sa mokrim kvačilima, i menjačko ulje u njemu mora da se menja prema pravilniku: na tome menjač i opstaje.
